i got a ton of emails from people saying  david there is a new straw poll out  for republicans in 2024 and trump  isn't winning you've got to talk about  it so i'm going to talk about it but  for better or worse i don't know if this  will bring pleasure or disdain or  sadness to people in the audience it's a  pretty meaningless poll  this is a poll from the western  conservative  summit and indeed republican florida  governor ron desantis  won over donald trump in this  straw poll that was conducted on  saturday  now let's look at the numbers this is a  poll  in which ron desantis came in first with  74  donald trump was second with 71  then you have ted cruz at 42 percent  mike pompeo  at 39 and tim scott at 35  now why is this a meaningless poll  result  it's meaningless because this is number  one it's a long time from now  first of all number two this is an  approval  poll so there are two things that make  it meaningless  for us for identifying trump's actual  chances  in 2024 number one it just asks you  do you approve of trump desantis whoever  not do you support them in 2024 as the  republican nominee  and number two you can vote uh yes  essentially i approve  for more than one person that's why it  doesn't add up to a hundred percent  desantis 74  trump 71. so this tells us  very very little about what's going to  go on in 2024  but i still think that there are some  interesting things to glean from this  why is it that desantis is doing well  desantis is doing well because he is a  more competent and i believe far more  dangerous version  of trump's authoritarian lunacy in a  sense  desantis is more trumpian than trump  to the degree that he can better  communicate his harebrained ideas  that he shares with donald trump himself  we've talked before about you know could  donald trump's presidency open the door  to an even dumber and even more  incompetent version of trump that  republicans would vote for the answer is  absolutely uh as i've said earlier and  before  if you overstate the intelligence of the  republican electorate you will be  disappointed  we thought in 2015 2016 okay there's a  lot of ignorant republicans who are  easily tricked  but they're not going to vote for trump  they're not this ignorant and then they  did  so could they vote for someone even  worse than trump  in terms of cartoonish incompetence yes  but the risk about desantis  is that he's more competent than donald  trump he's an authoritarian nut  with delusions based on supply-side  economic ideas and  religious conservatism and all this  stuff but he is more competent than  trump  he is more coherent in the presentation  of these bad ideas  and that has the potential to make him  far more dangerous than donald trump  actually is and that's a  really really scary thing so on the one  hand  it's an approval poll you can say i  approve of desantis  and i approve of trump um and  so that makes it of limited value to us  right now for 2024  it's also approval rather than who would  you vote for  it's also still the first half of 2021  so there are limited things we can glean  from this but if i am to glean  one thing here it's that donald trump's  worst uh instincts are present  in ron desantis and packaged more  competently  in terms of desantis's delivery and  quite frankly  desantis being from florida florida we  don't know what the map  is going to look like in 2024 a lot of  it will depend on how does 2022 go and  how much voter suppression is there and  many other things  but there is no doubt that if florida is  important  desantis as the republican nominee could  play  a very very big role there as well so  don't read too much into this  but an interesting straw poll  nonetheless
 

